### Check-ins y check-outs de una persona del equipo en un día (con JB014) — resultado esperado (200)
# Fechas en la hora local de quien consulta. targetUserId debe estar en su alcance.
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getWorkingActivity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 3026,
  "startDate": "2026-11-23T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-11-23T23:59:59"
}

### Persona fuera del alcance → 400 "No tiene acceso al usuario"
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getWorkingActivity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 5,
  "startDate": "2026-11-23T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-11-23T23:59:59"
}

### Rango mayor a 31 días → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getWorkingActivity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 3026,
  "startDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-03-01T00:00:00"
}

### Faltan campos → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getWorkingActivity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 3026
}

### Agente sin JB014 → 400 "No tiene permiso para ver la actividad del equipo"
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/getWorkingActivity
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAgent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 3026,
  "startDate": "2026-11-23T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-11-23T23:59:59"
}
